# The codebase is LF, and the toolchain reads these files directly: Metro
# resolves the .cjs configs, Node's type stripping runs the .ts sources, and
# `supabase db push` feeds the .sql straight to Postgres. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would hand every one of them back with
# CRLF on the next checkout and produce a 110-file diff nobody made.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Derived artefacts. Diffing them is meaningless and merging them is worse —
# both are regenerated by `npm run catalog`.
*.db binary
data/seed/catalog.sql -diff -merge
package-lock.json -diff
